    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>1级 杂兵 蛮战</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>小型 自然界 野兽</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 1；失手攻击无法伤害杂兵</span><span>''先攻'' +3</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 15，''强韧'' 12，''反射'' 14，''意志'' 12</span><span>''侦查'' +1</span></div>\n<div><span>''抗力'' 5 强酸</span><span>''感官'' 震动感知 5</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 6，掘穴 2（坑道）</span><span></span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">特性</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">幼虫群集</div>\n<div class=description>幼掘地虫对被任何掘地虫擒抱的目标的攻击骰获得+4 加值。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}爪击✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：+5 vs. AC<br>命中：4 点伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}颚部撕咬（强酸）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：+4 vs. AC<br>命中：6 点伤害。若该幼掘地虫对目标造成重击，则邻接该目标的每个生物受到 3 点强<br>酸伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"italic bg-flavortext\">（掘地虫）</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''技能'' 隐秘+8</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 10（+0）</span><span>''敏捷'' 16（+3）</span><span>''感知'' 12（+1）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 13（+1）</span><span>''智力'' 1（-5）</span><span>''魅力'' 2（-4）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 无</span></div></div>\n</div>",
